  "content": "W3C Indexed Database API 2.0 规范第 2.4 节明确规定：A key has an associated type which is one of: number, date, string, binary, or array。Boolean 类型不是合法键类型（valid key），无法在 IndexedDB 中为 boolean 字段直接建立索引或作为键路径查询。"
